window.products.push({"id":328107,"name":"Blue Rose Polish Pottery Golden Pastures Medium Covered Baking Dish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GqrtYwI2L._AC_SL1184_.jpg","description":"This Polish Pottery 10-inch Dish with Cover is made by Ceramika Artystyczna factory in Boleslawiec, Poland.Manufacturer shape number 662 (S415A), pattern number U79 (P0820A) - UNIKAT This Dish with Cover is hand painted and signed by artists Dimensions: 7¾\" wide, 10¼\" long, 4¾\" high Polish Pottery Stoneware is:* Hand painted in Boleslawiec, Poland* Microwave safe, dishwasher safe, oven safe up to 480 F, freezer safe* Lead and cadmium free* Crack and chip resistant* Intended for everyday use, easy to clean* ProductID: H2132H, shape: 662 (S415A), pattern: U79 (P0820A)* UNIKAT U79 Features and Manufacturing Process Polish pottery is created from white clay that is found only in the Boleslawiec region of Poland. The pottery is fired in coal and gas ovens at temperatures in excess of 2200 degrees Fahrenheit with a glaze that is lead and cadmium free. Polish pottery is known for it's versatility in that it is safe for use in the dishwasher, microwave, freezer and oven. Also, Polish Pottery is resilient to abrasives making it durable and resistant to scratching or chipping. It is this combination of function and beauty that makes Polish Pottery so appealing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GqrtYwI2L._AC_SL1184_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blue Rose Pottery","source_asin":"B00FSHF02I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-328107","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FSHF02I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FSHF02I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":328108,"name":"Pfaltzgraff Pistoulet 60-Piece Dinnerware Set (Service for 12)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414P89BVT1L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Serve your family and guests with the hand-painted Pfaltzgraff Pistoulet 60-Piece Dinnerware Set. This dinnerware set includes 12 each of 10-3/4-inch dinner plates, 9-inch salad plates, 28-ounce soup/cereal bowls, 8-ounce dessert bowls, and 14-ounce mugs. The set is crafted from high-quality, chip-resistant stoneware. This casual dining set is designed for long-lasting, everyday use. This piece is part of the Pfaltzgraff Pistoulet collection, featuring vibrant colors and sunflower patterns. The dinnerware set is dishwasher, freezer, oven, and microwave safe. Amazon.com An enchanted farmhouse in the French countryside, delightfully portrayed in Jana Kolpen's book The Secrets of Pistoulet , provides the inspiration for Pfaltzgraff's Pistoulet tableware. The hand-painted collection layers together an assortment of romantic rustic designs, from fleur-de-lis and polka dots to sunflowers and checkerboards to unfurling vines and ripe fruit. Sun-drenched shades of yellow, red, green and blue create a warm palette, while delicate banded borders and scalloped edges unite the set in a casually coordinated style. With or without the book, the pattern tells a story with fairytale charm. This 60-piece dinnerware set This 40-piece dinnerware set makes large entertaining tables of twelve feel cozy and intimate. Each 5-piece place setting includes a 10-3/4-inch dinner plate, a 9-inch salad plate, a 28-ounce soup/cereal bowl, an 8-ounce dessert bowl, and a 14-ounce mug. Complete the look with the whimsical accessories or mix in pieces from the sister Pistoulet Blue series for an even richer medley of colors and patterns. Crafted of durable stoneware, the set is dishwasher-, oven-, freezer-, and microwave-safe. Pfaltzgraff offers a five-year warranty against defects and replaces pieces individually. --Kara Karll What's in the Box 12 place settings. Each place setting consists of: 10-3/4-inch dinner plate; 9-inch salad plate; 28-ounce soup/cereal bowl; 8-ounce dessert bowl; 14-ounce mug. 60 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414P89BVT1L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pfaltzgraff","source_asin":"B000H6QSEO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-328108","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000H6QSEO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000H6QSEO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":328109,"name":"Lalafancy Swedish Dishcloths for Kitchen Cellulose Sponge Cloths, 12 Pack of Eco-Friendly No Odor Absorbent Kitchen Towel Reusable Cleaning Cloths","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rWvpjzJcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"70% Cellulose and 30% Cotton ✅【ULTRA ABSORBENT】Absorb liquids like magic and leave nothing behind! These color assorted Swedish dishcloths are 70% Cellulose / 30% Cotton. Works better than a microfiber towel or washcloth, they absorb up to 20x their weight. Durable and absorbs TONS of water like a sponge. Flexible like a cloth when wet/damp and can clean any surface or tight spot. ✅【REUSABLE & BIODEGRADABLE】Made of biodegradable, Eco-friendly materials, these dishcloths are fully biodegradable and made of cellulose. You can throw these away into your compost pile after you've felt like you’ve used them all up. You can generally wash and reuse these Swedish dishcloths up to more than 50 times! Going paperless has never been this easy. ✅【SAVE MONEY】Just using one of these Swedish dishcloths can replace over 15 rolls of paper towels! our multi use cloth can be used in place of your kitchen sponges, kitchen rags, dish towels, kitchen towels and dish cloths, wash cloths, cleaning rags, handi wipes reusable cloths and bamboo paper. ✅【EASY TO CLEAN】Lalafancy eco friendly cleaning cloths are dishwasher and washing machine safe for repeated use and less waste; Simply place the cleaning cloth on the top rack of a dishwasher or toss into your washing machine and air dry to avoid shrinking. ✅【VALUE PACK】This 12 pack washcloths comes with purple dishcloths, making them a premium yet value for money option. You will have the required supply of dishcloths for over a year to fulfill all your cleaning needs. Unlike regular dish rags and sponges, these dishcloths are fast drying and odor resistant.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rWvpjzJcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lalafancy","source_asin":"B089QN1Y38","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-328109","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089QN1Y38","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089QN1Y38","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
