window.products.push({"id":328166,"name":"DUJUST Cold Brew Maker, Airtight Iced Cold Brew Coffee Maker with 304 Stainless Steel Filter, Heat/Cold Resistant Borosilicate Glass, Large Spout Cold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ajAzDb4SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Money & Time Saving】If you're in the habit of picking up a cold brew on your way to work, you know how expensive that little morning routine can be. There has never been a better time to purchase a cold brew coffee maker for your home. Our cold coffee maker with a large-capacity and double-sided scale, is very easy to use and clean. 【Enjoy the Concentration and Smooth of Your Cold Coffee】With our bigger iced coffee pitcher, you can make large amounts of cold brew concentrate, and the longer filtration system ensures a smooth, strong result. The easy tap pour and bold flavor of the finished coffee earned your friends' compliments. Say goodbye to the sourness or the bitterness of hot coffee. 【Better Filtration & Airtight Seals】Our fine stainless steel filter effectively filters 15-micron coffee ground, fewer coffee grounds, 300% better filtering effect. Sealed silicone and stainless steel lid ensure a better taste. High borosilicate glass body, heat and cold resistant, more durable than plastic pitcher. 【How to make a wonderful Cup of Coffee】Making a flavorful cold brew starts with choosing the right beans and grinding them coarsely. Pour in the suggested amount of grounds, then slowly add the water to saturate them evenly. we suggest letting the grounds steep from 12 to 24 hours. Depending on your preference, you can dilute the cold brew concentrate to your taste or add some milk. 【90 Days Money Back, 1 Year Free Replacement】DUJUST is committed to providing our customers with high-quality glass set. And we ensure your satisfaction. If you have any questions about the product, please contact us, we are always keeping active to solve your problem. If you are not delighted with it, we will give you a 100% refund with no question asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ajAzDb4SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DUJUST","source_asin":"B09Q2P691S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-328166","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q2P691S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q2P691S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
