window.products.push({"id":328332,"name":"OMYSA Hanging Shelves for Wall - Set of 2 Hanging Shelf - Display Your Plants and Decor - Minimalist & Lightweight Floating Shelving - Use in Any Room","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AjGs9naHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE DESIGN - Add a new dimension to your space with our hanging shelves that is both chic and high quality. You’ll be surprised how big of a difference your room will feel! READY TO HANG - No need to spend hours trying to figure out how to hang these. Our hanging shelf ships fully assembled so you can simply just place the screws on your wall and you're done! BOHO ROOM DECOR - Display your favorite plants, pictures in style! Comes with a set of two boho shelves providing enough space so you can showcase the things you love and care about. CUSTOMIZABLE OPTIONS - With 4 different wood colors and 3 pairs of rings (gold, silver and black) it comes with, you can style our small hanging shelf the way you'd like! MINIMALIST DESIGN - The simple aesthetic is a great way to add some modern style into your home without being too flashy. Our wood shelf is lightweight yet sturdy enough that they won't fall off the wall when you put your favorite items on them. QUALITY MADE - Each shelf measures 17.5\" long and 5.5\" wide. Made from pine, you can appreciate the subtle wood grain of the wooden shelves giving off a clean and natural look to your home. THOUGHTFUL GIFT - Give the gift of creativity! This plant wall shelf is a unique item and is sure to be appreciated by anyone who loves plants or decorating their home with unique pieces. BRING YOUR WALLS TO LIFE - Our hanging shelves for wall belong in almost any room of your home - think plants and pictures in the living room and bedroom, organizing entryway or kitchen essentials or holding small books in your home office! PLANT DECOR: This hanging plant shelf is great choice for plant lovers. Integrate small plants into your living space with our swing shelves to create a vibrant and green indoor jungle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AjGs9naHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OMYSA","source_asin":"B082J8RZWD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-328332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082J8RZWD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082J8RZWD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":328333,"name":"Holymood Cutting Board with Juice Grooves, 17.7x 11.8 Wood Fiber Chopping Board with Handle, 2-In-1 Double Side Cutting Boards without Cracking, Non-P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OyGvFW1WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Enlarged Size】 Enlarged design can meet the needs of cutting watermelon, grilled meat, and other larger foods. A large, thick cutting board is always a hassle to use and clean because of its weight, but this cutting board is medium-thick to reduce weight, and you can even use it to serve food directly as a dinner plate after cutting. 17.7x 11.8x 0.55 Inch, 2.95lb. 【Eco-friendly Material】The wood fiber surface is made of high-density pressing of high-quality pine wood, which is harder than wood cutting boards, not easy to leave deep knife marks, juice and odor can not penetrate, have a comfortable cutting feeling while not cracking or chip like bamboo wood material, suitable for cutting meat. 【Wheat straw surface】-Environmentally friendly degradable material, will not crack or deform. It is harder than ordinary plastic cutting boards and will not have serious knife marks, but in order to protect the knife, the cutting board is softer than the knife, so the knife marks are unavoidable. The surface has a non-slip texture to keep food stable while cutting. 【Thoughtful Design】Both sides of the material are easy to clean, no need to apply oil and other tedious maintenance, will not be deformed. The juice grooves keep the countertop clean, the hook design is easy to store, and the rubber wrapped edge ensures that it will not slide around when in use. 【Satisfaction Service】Providing 100% customer satisfaction after-sales service is very important to us. If there is any damage or problem with the product you received, please feel free to contact the Holymood service team.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OyGvFW1WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOLYMOOD","source_asin":"B09VBYJJFY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-328333","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VBYJJFY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VBYJJFY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
