window.products.push({"id":328381,"name":"KOMFOTT 4 Inch Queen Gel Memory Foam Mattress Topper, Ventilated Ultra Soft Cooling Gel Mattress Pad, Pressure Relief Bed Topper for Back Pain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jd77nkKmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Soft and Total Support: This ultra-soft memory foam topper gives the extra layer of comfort and changes the hard feeling of your original mattress. It fully contours your body curve and distributes weight evenly to alleviate pressure points for an ergonomic sleep. ​No matter lying flat, sided, or face front, this bed topper offers you a sound sleep overnight. Cooling Gel Memory Foam: Our 4-inch memory foam mattress topper is equipped with cooling gel filling to optimize the cozy chilling touch and give you a restful sleep. It keeps all of the positive properties of memory foam mattress including the slow rebound and skin-friendly surface, while mitigating temperature issues. Ventilated Design for Clean and Fresh: Stay close enough and you can see the punctured mark in order. This kind of design facilitates the air flow for better ventilation and keeps a bad smell from brewing. This breathable mattress topper dispenses body heat, keeping you cool and comfortable. Certipur-US Certified Bed Mattress Topper: Meeting and exceeding the standard of Certipur-US credentials, this memory foam mattress topper is confident on the content, emission or durability. It is anti-allergic, so you can rest assured and enjoy a sneeze-free sleep. Well-Packaged & Easy Set Up: Arrives compressed and boxed for easy transport. All you need to do is to unroll the bed mattress topper, place it on the bed and wait for 48 hours to give it time to fully expand. There will be 4 sizes-- full, queen and king for you to choose your ideal topper.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jd77nkKmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KOMFOTT","source_asin":"B09TP6ZW4L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-328381","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TP6ZW4L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TP6ZW4L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
