window.products.push({"id":328535,"name":"La Rochere Set Of 6, 9.5-inch Napoleon Bee Dinner Plates","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FHBPOgbNL._AC_.jpg","description":"La Rochere’s “Napoleon Bee” Dinnerware is sturdy and perfect for everyday use. Classic in design, our dinner plates are both casual and elegant and will compliment any table. Easy to clean La Rochere glassware is dishwasher and microwave safe. La Rochere dinnerware is heavy duty while maintaining its simple charm. Steeped in tradition La Rochere is the oldest working art glassworks factory in France. La Rochere’s pieces are fired at a very high temperatures producing an exceptional quality glass that is both crystal clear and durable. A pressure seam is sometimes visible, which is the mark left by opening the mould in which the glass is pressed. It is the characteristic of pressed machine glass and symbolizes its heritage and makes each item a true piece of French glass history.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FHBPOgbNL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"La Rochere","source_asin":"B002DYJDBS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-328535","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002DYJDBS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002DYJDBS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":328536,"name":"Ticanble Door Draft Stopper, Adjustable Length 24\" to 38\",Bold Diameter 2\", Energy Saving, Dust Proof, Soundproofing, Weather Stripping Reusable Door ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513pQO4--0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Upgraded adjustable size】Under door draft blocker upgraded the foam tubes to 2 inch which fits tightly with the door especially for wider under door gaps,won't fall during the moving.Easily cut to length to fit doors 24\" to 38\" wide, suitable for most doors and windows. 【Use and protection】Door bottom seal is compatible with all kinds of floor. No matter carpet, marble, tile, linoleum or hardwood, this bottom door seal could work well with, while prevent making any scratches on the floor. You don't need to Install this door draft blocker with tape or nail, Just cut the appropriate length and adjust the sealing Velcro, push it into the door gap. So it will not damage your door or leave any scratches or traces of double-sided tape on the door. 【Durable waterproof cloth】Door weather stripping is made from strengthened cotton, which is built to last. Unlike the microfleece, cotton is much dirt-resistant and less water absorption. Make door draft blocker having better performance on waterproof and snowproof, so the sponge will not be moldy, more long-lasting and cleaner. 【Multiple uses】Our double-sided door draft stopper conveniently slides under doors and reduce noise, cold/hot air, wind, light, odor,noise or insect, and make the room more comfortable. It is suitable for all kinds of doors and Windows, as well as all kinds of flooring: wood floor, ceramic tile, marble, carpet, etc 【Energy saving】Door insulation could effectively to block out the cold air and keep your house warm and help reduce heating bills. Also this door cover is totally washing machine safe and would not deform,reusable. It's an eco-friendly and economical solution. The unique design can perfectly protect the comfort of the bedroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513pQO4--0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ticanble","source_asin":"B09TSGDKSW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-328536","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TSGDKSW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TSGDKSW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
