window.products.push({"id":328557,"name":"Kepooman Shoe Rack Bench for Kids,3 Tiers Bamboo Shoe Organizer Entryway Bench Storage Shelf for Hallway Bathroom Living Room,Wood Color","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JBdH-fSQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Take a try of this 90cm Strip Pattern Tiers Bamboo Stool Shoe Rack for Kids!Due to its user-friendly design with different heights,this shoe rack is suitable for both adults and kids.As a shoe rack,it is designed into tiers for storage in order.In addition to its shoe rack function,it is also a nice stool for you to conveniently wear or take off your shoes.Adopting superior bamboo material and with fine workmanship,it is solid and durable to use.It is a compact item,which won't occupy much space! Features: a.Well-designed shoe rack, acting as a stool as well b.Premium bamboo is sustainable a kids or an adult c.With different heights for satisfying kids and adults d.Strip style makes the shoe rack stylish in look e.It helps to keep your shoes in order and make your house tidy and neat Specifications: 1.Material: Bamboo 2.Color: Wood Color 3.Dimensions: (35.43 x 11.02 x 17.72)\" / (90 x 28 x 45)cm (L x W x H) 4.Weight: 9.81 lbs / 4.45 kg 5.Weight Capacity: 551 lbs / 250 kg 6.Space Between Tier: 6.1\" / 15.5cm 7.Space Between Bottom Tier and Floor: 3.35\" / 8.5cm Package Includes: 1 x Shoe Rack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JBdH-fSQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kepooman","source_asin":"B07N6SFCFV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-328557","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N6SFCFV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N6SFCFV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":328558,"name":"PHF True Velvet Pillowcases Standard Size, 2 Pack Soft Color Gradient Pillow Shams Covers with Envelope Closure, Luxury Cozy Decorative Pillow Cases, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rsn7RLVDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Velvet Comfort All Year Round: The pillow shams are made of 100% velvet fabric, which features fluffy feel, softness and breathability, offering extreme comfort. AND it's legit velvet! Not that weird felt/faux fuzzy suede weirdness that people are trying to pass off as velvet nowadays.Just like laying on cloud when laying on your favorite pillow which wearing our velvet pillowcases. Extra Elegant Appearance: The velvet fabric with special craftsmanship feature amazing color gradient and shadow effect in different light intensity and angle. Especially in your home, under the night lights, the throw pillow cover of solid color shows however contrast half-light half-dark appearance, giving your home an extraodinary style and luxurious allure. Envelope Closure Design: The velvet pillowcases has an delicate opening at the back. Unique designed envelope overlap closure can cover, protect, and keep your pillow clean and in place. What's more, compaired to zipper closure that easily snags or broken, envelop clousure is more convenient and more durable. Easy Care: Machine wash separately in cold water, gentle cycle. Do not bleach. Tumble dry on low heat or lay flat to dry. Remove promptly. Warm iron as needed. No pilling, no shrink, no fade, labor tests show that the pillow shams keep its shape and stay brands new after 100+ wash cycles. Package Include: PHF 100% velvet pillow cases, Standard Size, 20\" X 26\", pack of 2. Covers only, no pillow insert.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rsn7RLVDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PHF","source_asin":"B09XXMZG1K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-328558","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XXMZG1K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XXMZG1K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
