window.products.push({"id":328662,"name":"DICTAC Full Led Bed Frame with Button Tufted Headboard Modern Wave-Like Curve Upholstered Platform Bed Frame with LED Lights Faux Leather Low Profile ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TPqvUgr1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔵【Modern Cool Style】The sense of ritual is indispensable in life,colorful lights make your life relaxing and exciting. Our Led bed frame uses RGB light bars, the light bars located under the wood frames on both sides of the Mattress Foundation and be controlled by Phone App or Remote Control.Over 60000 colors can choose and you can effortlessly switch the light color, brightness, speed, Music mode and timing function to create your favorite bedroom atmosphere. ✅【Unique Wave Like Curve Design】DICTAC Modern Upholstered Bed Frame is covered by durable faux pU leather for ultimate comfort and looks, showcasing a futuristic design.As the same time,Wave Like Curve and low profile upholstered design is soft and anti-collision,keep your family safe.The Headboard of the LED low profile bed frame uses a button tufted design to add a fashionable feeling. Recommend the mattress thickness of 8-14 inches. 🌛【Stability is Everything】DICTAC full size led bed frame with strong solid wooden connecting frame and 13 closely spaced wooden slats, can better distribute weight and protect your mattress from sagging giving your various types of mattresses the support it needs without the box spring. Plus 9 sturdy legs to ensure the durability and stability of the upholstered platform bed frame,create a quiet sleeping environment and provide strong support easily up to 900 LBS. 🌛【Enjoy Every Silently Second For a Good Sleep】Velcro slats design, simplify the installation steps of the slats and offer stability between slats and foundation to eliminate the friction noise from the root cause.3 adjustable feet, even if your floor is uneven, you can adjust the height of the feet to make the bed more stable and keep quiet. Very little friction between the wooden slats and the solid wood frame to prevent noise, reduce wood slats wear and extend the life of the LED bed frame. 🧭【Quick & Easy Assembly】Our modern upholstered led bed frame comes with detailed instruction, assembly tools and numbered parts, only take 45 minutes to assemble even for a rookie.🌞【Excellent Service】 you have any problem after receiving the LED bed frame, please feel free to contact us,DCTAC always replies and solve your problem within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TPqvUgr1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DICTAC","source_asin":"B0C4TP5MNM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-328662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4TP5MNM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4TP5MNM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
