window.products.push({"id":328684,"name":"GooQee Automatic Touchless Countertop Liquid Soap Dispenser with IR Sensor - Remain Visible Window - Waterproof Base for Kitchen Bathroom Sanitizer Sh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61666ih7KnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"GooQee Automatic Touchless Liquid Soap Dispenser comes with innovative infra-red sensor technology provides a sanitary, no-touch and easy-to-use operation that will only be activated when needed. Ideal for kitchen, bathroom, hospital, school, hotel, restaurant, workshop, etc., to stop spreading germs. OPERATION TIPS: 1. Clean it with water before 1st time use. Clean it each time for using different soap2. Slide switch to OFF and install batteries before filling soap3. The viscosity of the soap will affect dosing quantity. The thicker soap, the little soap comes out. If the soap is too thin, then much soap flow. You can choose right soap as per your requirement.4. The longer time you hold your hand there, the more soap is dispensed (but it will automatically cease after 4 seconds to save soap). Simply moving your hand once you get enough soap5. Please remove the batteries if long time not to use6. Do not immerse the bottom of the dispenser in water. 7. Do not expose the dispenser directly into strong sunlight which will cause automatically dispensing TROUBLESHOOTING - NOT WORKING 1. Please make sure the batteries installed correctly2. Remain less than 40ml will stop dispensing. Refill it regularly3. Low Temperature will stop dispensing. The working temperature is 3℃~40℃ (37°F-104°F)4. Nozzle blocked will stop dispensing. Clean it with water SPECIFICATION Material: Chrome + ABS plastic Capacity of dispenser: Max: 12oz (340ml), Min: 1.4oz (40ml)Capacity of dispensing: 0.14oz (4ml)Input Power: 4x1.5V AAA Battery(not included)  Dimension: 5 x 3 x 7.5inch (130 x 80 x 190mm) Item Weight: 245gCertification:CE, FCC, RoHSGuarantee: 12 months warranty Package Contents: 1 x Soap Dispenser(Black), 1 x User Manual (Soap not included)Click Add to Cart now and try GooQee Automatic soap dispenser to keep your home GERM FREE!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61666ih7KnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GooQee","source_asin":"B01GCMFMA2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-328684","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GCMFMA2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GCMFMA2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
