window.products.push({"id":328799,"name":"wattstar 2PCS Car Headrest Pillows, Soft Car Neck Pillows, Genuine Leather Neck Pillow for Neck Support, Memory Foam Car Pillow for Driving, Neck Pain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K7JJb7edL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Breathable Genuine Leather Pillowcase 】Most of the headrest pillows in the market, they are not the real leather pillows and with cheap cotton pillow core inside. Wattstar neck support pillows are made of genuine leather with mesh design. It is breathable and easy to clean the pillow cover. 【100% Memory Foam】 The neack pain relief pillows cores are made up of memory foam instead of sponge. They are high densities which are pretty soft, comfortable and bouncy. For each pillow core, there is an extra fabric layer to cover the memory foam to avoid from dust. In ergonomic design and well protect to your head and cervical spine. 【Elastic Straps To Fit And Adjust】 There are two stretchy straps for the cervical pillows. Is is perfect to fit your car seats and tighten the headrest pillows. No more moves and keep them in place. Noted: Please do not try to overstretch the elastic band to avoid tearing of the strap and the fabric. Please adjust the pillow to your ideal position referring to your height. 【2PCS In Vacuum Packaging】 It is time to upgrade your car seat pillows for the driver and passenger side. Choose wattstasr headrests and enjoy the comfy driving experience with your loved ones. They help to relief your neck and shoulder pain to a lage extent. Please note: After receiving the package, please open the package and place the pillows in a dry and clean place for expanding to their full size. If the memory foam rebounds slowly, please press to help the memory foam to rebound. 【After-sales Services】 Your satisfactions and product qualities are always the things we care so much. If there are anything about the memory foam pillows, please tell us and we will solve them for you as best as we can.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K7JJb7edL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"wattstar","source_asin":"B09VSRV2DW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-328799","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VSRV2DW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VSRV2DW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
