window.products.push({"id":328954,"name":"Oline ErgoMax Ergonomic Office Chair - Rolling Home Desk Chair with 4D Adjustable Flip Armrests, 3D Adjustable Lumbar Support and Blade Wheels - Mesh ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":197.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ld7M6sFQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGHLIGHTED ELEMENTS: Sitting is important because it happens often throughout the day, so you want to get the most out of it. Being sedentary isn’t a bad thing when your office chair is a comfortable one. When you’re able to utilize it in every aspect, it’s a great sitting experience. Be it in your office, gaming room, business, or at your workspace at home, you won’t want to get up, and this phenomenal ergonomic chair proves Oline stands out amongst its competitors. COMFORT IS ALWAYS KEY: Executive chairs of yesteryear were either bulky or had bad lumbar support. A time when your neck didn’t have a headrest, and your posterior was barely on the seat itself. This made for an uncomfortable time at the job, especially for eight hours. This first-rate desk chair from Oline will have you thinking otherwise. They succeed in bringing you comfortable, painless, and supportive seating. Their standout products go unmatched. NEXT-LEVEL ERGONOMICS: Understanding the importance of back support is essential. There are a few components that go into sitting down, and being comfortable while doing so. Your neck and head need to be supported at all times. If not pain and discomfort will ensue. In addition, your back needs good posture and your spine needs to be in proper alignment. Your hips need the relief of pressure. That’s where lumbar support and the tilt feature are key factors. ADJUSTABILITY: The word adjustability plays a big part in the makeup of this state-of-the-art ergonomic office chair. This stylish and contemporary beauty features an adjustable armrest and headrest, and exceptional lumbar support. The special tilt feature does wonders for your body. This computer chair was made for the curvature of your spine. You’re in control of your comfort, and this chair is there for the needed support, both literally and figuratively. DIMENSIONS & 411: Get the most out of this easy-to-assemble, incomparable gaming chair. It measures 26\"D x 26\"W x 53\"H. Its durable yet lightweight frame can hold up to 275 lbs. It features a black, nylon material, along with a streamlined mesh back, and a stunning silver swivel base with matching caster blade wheels that roll around so smoothly. The neck rest and armrests adjust to your chosen positions and level of comfortability, making this your go-to seat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ld7M6sFQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oline","source_asin":"B09NPB1WG8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-328954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NPB1WG8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NPB1WG8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
